# Pinned checksums for the Windows Server 2025 evaluation build (issue #14).
# scripts/build-windows-image.sh refuses to build unless both files below
# are in $LAB_IMAGE_CACHE/iso on the lab host and match these lines.
#
# windows-server-2025-eval.iso: fetched by hand through Microsoft's
# Evaluation Center form (a scripted request is refused), en-US, build
# 26100.32230. The unattend file selects the image by name, not index:
#   Windows Server 2025 SERVERSTANDARDCORE  (index 1, edition ServerStandardEval)
#
# virtio-win-0.1.302.iso: the Fedora virtio-win archive release 0.1.302-1,
#   archive-virtio/virtio-win-0.1.302-1/virtio-win-0.1.302.iso
# The archive publishes md5 sums of its rpms only; this sum is the ISO
# inside virtio-win-0.1.302-1.noarch.rpm, whose md5 matched the archive's
# CHECKSUM file (66f65c16ab3e8dfe12c2855a0d1ac303).
7b052573ba7894c9924e3e87ba732ccd354d18cb75a883efa9b900ea125bfd51  windows-server-2025-eval.iso
303f7ae40dad495d6ae474fdc571df58958a4dbc5c37a522d80f9a203867949d  virtio-win-0.1.302.iso
